WEBVTT

00:00.620 --> 00:04.360
What time are you coming 
over on our next day off?

00:04.840 --> 00:08.030
Misuzu? When did you make plans to do that?

00:08.030 --> 00:10.640
I didn't. I thought she meant you.

00:10.640 --> 00:12.860
'Cause that's the first 
time I've mentioned it.

00:28.710 --> 00:34.010
<i>When I throw a jab or a straight,
 it always lands</i>

00:34.010 --> 00:39.140
<i>But when I'm aiming for your heart,
 I miss every time</i>

00:39.140 --> 00:44.480
<i>Parallel, zigzagging, awkward, incoherent</i>

00:44.480 --> 00:48.980
<i>When you look my way and move closer to me</i>

00:48.980 --> 00:54.740
<i>I know it doesn't mean the same thing for you</i>

00:54.740 --> 00:59.780
<i>But I wish we could stay like this forever</i>

00:59.780 --> 01:05.910
<i>My changing feelings are driving me crazy</i>

01:05.910 --> 01:11.210
<i>The moment you turn to face me,
 take that! Telepathy</i>

01:11.210 --> 01:16.680
<i>If only we could feel the same thing</i>

01:16.680 --> 01:21.560
<i>I want to kick this pesky subtlety away</i>

01:21.560 --> 01:27.560
<i>I want to know everything, 
I want to know everything</i>

01:27.560 --> 01:30.110
<i>I can't fool you forever</i>

01:30.110 --> 01:32.730
<i>I can't keep this hidden</i>

01:32.730 --> 01:37.490
<i>I want to shout out my secret, AHHH</i>

01:39.410 --> 01:41.950
<i>Take that! Telepathy</i>

01:41.950 --> 01:44.410
<i>Te-te-te-telepathy</i>

01:45.120 --> 01:47.500
<i>Telepathy</i>

01:49.210 --> 01:52.960
<b>The Girls of the Olston Family</b>

01:49.880 --> 01:52.170
"The Girls of the Olston Family."

01:52.960 --> 01:59.930
<b>Carol's House</b>

01:52.960 --> 01:59.930
<b>Forest</b>

01:52.960 --> 01:59.930
<b>Convenience Store</b>

01:52.960 --> 01:59.930
<b>Right Here</b>

01:52.960 --> 01:59.930
<b>Big Building</b>

01:52.960 --> 01:59.930
<b>Building</b>

01:52.960 --> 01:59.930
<b>Station</b>

01:53.840 --> 01:57.340
Carol really didn't put much thought 
into this map she gave us.

01:57.340 --> 01:59.930
I'm not sure if I'd even call it a map.

01:59.930 --> 02:02.100
It should be around here,

02:02.100 --> 02:04.720
but there's nothing but a 
fence with no end in sight.

02:05.390 --> 02:07.520
I wonder if it's some sort of facility.

02:12.730 --> 02:15.480
It's... not here, right?

02:15.480 --> 02:17.280
I really want to hope it isn't.

02:17.610 --> 02:20.200
Oh! You two!

02:21.570 --> 02:25.330
What are you doing just standing 
in front of my house?

02:25.330 --> 02:27.120
Are you bad people?

02:27.620 --> 02:29.040
<i>No mistaking it.</i>

02:29.040 --> 02:31.500
<i>They're definitely related.</i>

02:33.040 --> 02:35.500
You're Carol-chan's friends?

02:35.800 --> 02:37.630
Is that true?

02:37.970 --> 02:40.590
Especially you, the tall one!

02:40.590 --> 02:43.050
You don't have any perverted intentions?

02:43.050 --> 02:44.100
Huh?!

02:44.100 --> 02:48.480
I know that all boys are...

02:48.680 --> 02:50.480
Oh. Breasts.

02:51.600 --> 02:55.480
Um... For what it's worth, 
I'm actually a girl.

02:56.780 --> 02:59.610
Oh, okay! Come on in!

03:00.530 --> 03:01.950
I want to go home.

03:01.950 --> 03:05.370
Don't leave! I can't handle this on my own!

03:05.870 --> 03:08.790
The path to our house is like a maze,

03:08.790 --> 03:11.040
so make sure you follow me closely.

03:11.330 --> 03:14.040
Even I get lost sometimes, but still...

03:14.040 --> 03:14.670
Huh?!

03:15.290 --> 03:17.920
I'm sure it will be just fine today!

03:19.050 --> 03:22.930
At least, I sure hope it will be!

03:23.550 --> 03:25.050
<i>I'm having all of the bad feelings...</i>

03:25.050 --> 03:27.140
<i>Maybe I really should go home...</i>

03:30.350 --> 03:32.810
Welcome back, Mummy!

03:32.810 --> 03:35.270
I'm home, Carol-chan!

03:36.360 --> 03:40.110
I miss you so much! I love you so much!

03:40.360 --> 03:41.150
Oh!

03:41.530 --> 03:43.910
Yay! Tomo-chan's here!

03:43.910 --> 03:44.660
Hey...

03:44.660 --> 03:47.530
Thank you for coming! You too, Misuzu-chan!

03:47.910 --> 03:48.830
Thank—

03:50.080 --> 03:51.210
Harsh.

03:52.330 --> 03:53.120
Oh!

03:53.750 --> 03:56.460
Look! We have matching braids!

04:04.760 --> 04:06.350
Meanie.

04:11.520 --> 04:13.730
Wh-What <i>is</i> this place?!

04:14.100 --> 04:15.770
It's my room.

04:15.770 --> 04:18.190
What are you? A princess?!

04:18.190 --> 04:20.030
Are you a princess?!

04:20.230 --> 04:21.780
Huh? Yeah.

04:21.780 --> 04:24.200
No way!

04:23.030 --> 04:24.860
Would you calm down?

04:24.860 --> 04:26.530
She's just really rich.

04:28.080 --> 04:30.490
This is me when I was little.

04:30.830 --> 04:32.290
Wow...

04:32.290 --> 04:34.790
You've always worn ribbons 
in your hair, huh?

04:34.790 --> 04:36.710
Yep. Mummy used to say

04:37.000 --> 04:39.000
that I'm pudding.

04:39.000 --> 04:39.750
Say what?

04:40.130 --> 04:41.170
Pudding.

04:41.920 --> 04:45.970
That's why I always wear soft, cute clothes.

04:45.970 --> 04:49.100
The ribbon is the cherry, 
and you can't forget the cherry!

04:49.100 --> 04:51.470
But the most important thing is...

04:51.470 --> 04:53.140
Not letting anyone eat you?

04:53.390 --> 04:54.310
Huh?

04:54.310 --> 04:57.690
How'd you know? Amazing!

04:58.650 --> 05:00.820
I'm going to use your bathroom.

05:01.230 --> 05:03.030
Sure. It's...

05:03.030 --> 05:05.610
I saw it on the way in. I can find it.

05:21.880 --> 05:22.630
Um...

05:23.090 --> 05:25.220
Is there something you want from me?

05:25.220 --> 05:29.090
You were mean to Carol-chan earlier.

05:29.470 --> 05:31.560
Are you actually a bad girl?

05:32.510 --> 05:34.480
That's what this is about?

05:40.270 --> 05:42.940
If I said I'm friends with 
her for her money...

05:43.730 --> 05:46.070
What would you do?

05:51.410 --> 05:54.290
I'm sorry. You're a very cute girl!

05:54.290 --> 05:55.450
Uh, thanks...

05:56.870 --> 06:00.210
<i>Why do I feel like I just lost?</i>

06:00.710 --> 06:03.130
Tomo-chan, let's play Othello.

06:03.380 --> 06:05.710
Sure! I won't go easy on you!

06:05.710 --> 06:07.800
Okay, I'll be white.

06:08.300 --> 06:10.760
m 202 266 l 203 335 437 336 437 265

06:08.300 --> 06:10.760
<b>5 Minutes Later</b>

06:13.600 --> 06:15.470
Oh, Othello?

06:16.480 --> 06:19.900
My Misuzu here is really 
good at this kind of game!

06:19.900 --> 06:20.900
You'd better be ready!

06:21.440 --> 06:24.480
Well, it's true that I don't often lose.

06:24.480 --> 06:26.530
Okay, I'll be white.

06:26.940 --> 06:29.410
m 202 266 l 203 335 437 336 437 265

06:26.940 --> 06:29.410
<b>10 Minutes Later</b>

06:32.830 --> 06:35.160
What kind of mother and daughter <i>are</i> you?

06:35.160 --> 06:37.330
Huh? What do you mean?

06:39.120 --> 06:40.290
Bye, Carol.

06:40.620 --> 06:42.000
See you at school.

06:42.000 --> 06:43.500
Thank you for having us.

06:44.630 --> 06:47.460
Please come visit again sometime!

06:48.090 --> 06:49.380
And you, too.

06:50.130 --> 06:51.890
Come by again!

06:51.890 --> 06:52.800
I don't know...

06:53.510 --> 06:55.010
And last is...

06:55.010 --> 06:56.970
Carol-chan!

06:56.270 --> 06:58.390
Mummy!

06:59.100 --> 07:00.060
Let's go.

07:02.810 --> 07:04.190
Yeah.

07:10.490 --> 07:14.160
<b>A Feeling I Won't Give Up</b>

07:10.860 --> 07:12.570
"A Feeling I Won't Give Up."

07:14.330 --> 07:16.950
Hey, Misuzu, did you hear?

07:16.950 --> 07:19.040
We have midterms tomorrow!

07:19.870 --> 07:22.880
I'm more shocked that 
you asked me if I knew.

07:22.880 --> 07:26.670
I completely forgot! I'm in so much trouble!

07:26.670 --> 07:29.050
In that case, let's have 
a study group today.

07:29.050 --> 07:32.010
Really? Don't you have to study, too?

07:32.010 --> 07:35.180
I don't mind. We can do it at my house.

07:36.430 --> 07:37.970
Can I come, too?

07:40.520 --> 07:42.270
Sure, I guess...

07:42.270 --> 07:43.850
Thank you.

07:43.850 --> 07:45.020
Stop talking like that.

07:46.110 --> 07:47.230
Tomo!

07:47.520 --> 07:49.820
Let's study together after school.

07:49.820 --> 07:51.360
I'll be your tutor.

07:51.360 --> 07:52.490
Huh?!

07:52.910 --> 07:56.080
You'll tutor Tomo, you say?

07:56.080 --> 07:57.530
Don't be so full of yourself.

07:57.530 --> 07:58.330
What?

07:58.790 --> 08:02.250
What was your ranking in our 
last middle school exam?

08:02.250 --> 08:05.290
Huh? I think I ranked around 30.

08:05.750 --> 08:07.130
So what?

08:07.590 --> 08:11.090
I ranked... number one.

08:11.420 --> 08:14.260
Damn it!

08:17.390 --> 08:19.850
I'm kinda surprised, though.

08:20.350 --> 08:21.350
About what?

08:21.350 --> 08:26.650
Well, you usually try to get 
me and Jun together, right?

08:26.650 --> 08:28.360
So why this ti—

08:30.570 --> 08:33.320
I'm allowed every now 
and then, too, aren't I?

08:34.410 --> 08:36.320
Do that to me, too.

08:36.320 --> 08:37.410
No.

08:39.950 --> 08:41.500
I haven't been here in a while.

08:41.500 --> 08:43.790
It looks pretty different in here now.

08:43.790 --> 08:46.080
You haven't been here very much, either?

08:46.080 --> 08:49.420
When we were kids, she told 
me not to come to her house.

08:49.420 --> 08:51.510
I don't remember why, though.

08:52.210 --> 08:54.010
You don't remember?

08:54.760 --> 08:57.680
It's because you kept breaking 
everything in my house.

08:57.680 --> 09:00.390
Oh... Th-That's right.

09:00.390 --> 09:03.600
You just weren't the kind of child 
that could play sitting down.

09:03.600 --> 09:05.770
Even today, I'm actually super worried.

09:05.770 --> 09:07.810
C'mon, that's not gonna 
be a problem anymore!

09:09.270 --> 09:10.400
I'm home.

09:13.440 --> 09:14.610
Don't tell me...

09:15.320 --> 09:16.950
Misuzu has a boyfriend?!

09:18.660 --> 09:19.620
Mom.

09:19.620 --> 09:20.990
Welcome home.

09:20.990 --> 09:22.120
Hey, I'm here to visit!

09:22.120 --> 09:23.200
Akemi?!

09:23.200 --> 09:25.830
Uh, no, I'm her daughter...

09:25.830 --> 09:26.960
Tomo-chan?

09:28.670 --> 09:30.840
You do look just like her.

09:30.840 --> 09:33.050
But don't grow up to <i>be</i> like her.

09:33.050 --> 09:34.170
Uh-huh...

09:34.170 --> 09:37.470
Nice to meet you. My name is Carol.

09:37.470 --> 09:39.680
Most people don't get this close 
when meeting for the first time.

09:40.010 --> 09:42.390
You look just as cute as Misuzu-chan!

09:45.020 --> 09:46.390
I'm not sold on this one.

09:46.390 --> 09:47.440
Aw...

09:47.440 --> 09:48.350
I'm not, either.

09:48.350 --> 09:50.020
Aw...

09:51.020 --> 09:53.570
I don't get this at all.

09:53.900 --> 09:56.950
It's just a long equation. It's not hard.

09:56.950 --> 09:59.620
Let's walk through it a step at a time.

09:59.620 --> 10:02.950
It's √10/2-√2, right?

10:04.240 --> 10:05.040
Huh?

10:06.790 --> 10:07.750
She's right.

10:07.750 --> 10:09.000
For real?!

10:09.210 --> 10:12.670
It's an easy problem, but not one you 
should be able to do in your head...

10:12.670 --> 10:13.750
I could.

10:13.750 --> 10:15.460
Are you some kinda genius?!

10:15.670 --> 10:16.920
How'd you do that?!

10:16.920 --> 10:20.300
Well, these ones here are friends,

10:20.300 --> 10:23.850
so if you whip this around here 
and smoosh it onto here...

10:23.850 --> 10:25.680
If math could be solved 
that way, anyone could...

10:25.850 --> 10:28.100
Whoa, that's amazing! It worked!

10:28.100 --> 10:28.730
See?

10:28.730 --> 10:31.020
Oh, man! I might be a genius!

10:31.020 --> 10:32.650
Tomo-chan the genius!

10:32.940 --> 10:35.230
I don't know what you did,

10:35.230 --> 10:38.610
but in math, the process is 
as important as the solution.

10:38.610 --> 10:41.120
You won't get credit if you 
can't show your work.

10:41.120 --> 10:42.410
What a pain.

10:42.410 --> 10:45.370
You said it! That's so inefficient!

10:48.210 --> 10:51.290
Okay! Now I'm ready to get serious!

10:51.290 --> 10:52.840
Me, too!

10:53.290 --> 10:57.420
There's a lot going on here, 
so you can express all this as x.

10:57.420 --> 10:59.300
Oh, you're right! That's much better!

10:59.300 --> 11:01.760
You're a good teacher, Misuzu-chan.

11:01.760 --> 11:05.100
You really are. You've got a knack for this.

11:05.100 --> 11:06.850
I'd say this much is just normal.

11:06.850 --> 11:08.640
Don't be so modest!

11:08.640 --> 11:11.270
I mean, you're good enough 
to make <i>me</i> understand!

11:11.730 --> 11:13.650
If I can keep this up,

11:13.650 --> 11:16.980
I might actually be able to go 
to the same university as you!

11:18.070 --> 11:19.240
You want to do that?

11:19.450 --> 11:21.450
Of course I do!

11:21.450 --> 11:23.910
I was barely able to follow 
you into this high school,

11:23.910 --> 11:25.700
so it might not be easy,

11:26.200 --> 11:28.290
but you're my best friend, after all!

11:31.170 --> 11:32.420
I see...

11:35.250 --> 11:38.260
Okay, okay. You can follow me, too.

11:44.720 --> 11:46.560
Heck yeah!

11:46.220 --> 11:50.520
<b>70 • Aizawa Tomo</b>

11:46.560 --> 11:48.020
I'm number 70!

11:48.020 --> 11:50.520
That's the first time I've 
ever ranked in the top half!

11:50.520 --> 11:53.350
Looks like you were in good shape this time.

11:53.350 --> 11:55.480
Yeah! What was your rank?

11:55.480 --> 11:56.860
I got 54!

11:56.860 --> 11:58.190
Not bad, not great.

11:58.190 --> 11:59.860
You're so boring.

12:03.860 --> 12:06.030
Most people don't do stuff like this.

12:06.030 --> 12:07.910
Well, <i>he</i> does.

12:09.370 --> 12:11.210
What was your rank, Misuzu?

12:11.210 --> 12:12.120
Second.

12:12.120 --> 12:14.250
Wow, I should've expected as much!

12:14.250 --> 12:16.130
Who was number one?

12:14.880 --> 12:17.090
<b>1 • Carol Olston</b>

12:24.130 --> 12:27.930
<b>Heart-Pounding!</b>

12:24.130 --> 12:27.930
<b>A Gaming Overnighter</b>

12:24.640 --> 12:27.100
"Heart-Pounding! A Gaming Overnighter."

12:28.510 --> 12:31.890
I bought that game you said 
you were interested in.

12:31.890 --> 12:33.140
<i>Winners Eleven</i>.

12:33.140 --> 12:35.600
Oh, nice!

12:35.600 --> 12:38.770
My parents almost never buy me video games.

12:38.770 --> 12:43.320
Come to think of it, when we first met,
 you were a gamer kid, huh?

12:44.530 --> 12:46.620
Hey, gamer kid!

12:53.460 --> 12:55.370
That takes me back!

12:56.380 --> 12:58.710
Hey, cut it out!

12:59.460 --> 13:01.670
Never call me that again.

13:01.670 --> 13:03.920
Wh-What's with you?

13:09.180 --> 13:11.180
Wanna come over today?

13:11.180 --> 13:13.730
We'll do some gaming together,
 like we used to.

13:13.730 --> 13:14.940
Really?! I can?!

13:14.940 --> 13:16.770
Of course you can.

13:17.100 --> 13:19.770
There's no school tomorrow, 
so you can even stay over.

13:19.770 --> 13:22.030
We can play games until super late!

13:22.030 --> 13:24.240
A gaming overnighter, huh?

13:24.530 --> 13:26.070
I can't wait!

13:27.660 --> 13:30.950
I was so distracted by gaming,
 I didn't realize!

13:31.240 --> 13:34.660
I'm spending the night at Jun's house!

13:35.000 --> 13:37.120
<i>There's all sorts of gaming going on here.</i>

13:37.330 --> 13:40.500
So... can I come, too?

13:40.500 --> 13:43.050
You'll go with me, Carol?!

13:43.550 --> 13:46.010
This is a thing I shouldn't go to, isn't it?

13:46.010 --> 13:48.590
If you know that, don't complicate things.

13:48.840 --> 13:50.350
No! I shouldn't do this!

13:50.760 --> 13:51.850
I'm gonna tell him no!

13:52.060 --> 13:53.640
Wait, Tomo-chan.

13:53.930 --> 13:55.230
Sit down.

13:55.230 --> 13:56.600
Why?

13:56.600 --> 13:58.350
Don't ask why. Just sit down.

13:59.060 --> 14:00.650
Just sit, okay?

14:01.230 --> 14:03.230
You telling him no...

14:03.230 --> 14:04.570
...is not an option.

14:05.820 --> 14:08.990
<i>It's only at times like this 
that they get along.</i>

14:09.700 --> 14:11.910
Tomo! Walk home with me!

14:12.950 --> 14:14.370
Jun!

14:14.660 --> 14:18.420
I'm, uh... walking with 
Misuzu and Carol today.

14:18.420 --> 14:21.460
Oh, okay. I'll wait for you at home, then.

14:21.460 --> 14:23.170
S-Sure.

14:28.680 --> 14:31.930
Fighting it is useless. 
You're seeing him later anyway.

14:31.930 --> 14:33.600
Yeah, at his house.

14:34.520 --> 14:39.060
Going home separately actually seems 
like a tease. Almost as if...

14:39.060 --> 14:40.020
As if?

14:40.020 --> 14:42.860
Oh, just shut up, damn it!

14:44.020 --> 14:46.320
I'm gonna stay over at Jun's house tonight.

14:46.780 --> 14:47.650
Huh?

14:48.150 --> 14:50.030
Wh-What?

14:50.030 --> 14:53.950
I see. I thought we still 
had a lot more time...

14:54.580 --> 14:57.500
But maybe it's time to start considering it.

14:57.500 --> 14:58.160
Huh?

14:58.870 --> 15:00.330
My grandchild's name.

15:00.330 --> 15:02.500
You're jumping <i>way</i> ahead here!

15:02.880 --> 15:05.420
Dad! I'm staying over at Jun's tonight!

15:07.550 --> 15:11.340
Okay. Don't make too much trouble for them.

15:11.890 --> 15:12.850
Huh?

15:13.890 --> 15:16.350
What's the problem? You can go on over.

15:19.940 --> 15:23.770
<i>It's actually kinda unsettling that 
they're not concerned at all.</i>

15:24.520 --> 15:26.230
I've been waiting for you, Tomo!

15:26.900 --> 15:29.820
Mom told me to bring you this.

15:29.820 --> 15:33.280
Cool, thanks! I'll let my mom know tomorrow.

15:33.280 --> 15:34.120
Tomorrow?

15:34.370 --> 15:36.910
Yeah. She's not home today.

15:38.370 --> 15:39.750
Went on a trip, apparently.

15:39.750 --> 15:42.580
Why didn't you tell me that sooner?!

15:42.580 --> 15:45.460
Huh? Did you need to talk 
to my mom or something?

15:45.460 --> 15:47.920
That's not the issue here!

15:49.420 --> 15:51.800
You make such awesome curry, Jun.

15:52.220 --> 15:53.930
I'll make some for you sometime.

15:53.930 --> 15:55.470
Oh, yeah...

15:55.470 --> 15:59.220
Every now and then... I do 
want to try your cooking.

15:59.220 --> 16:02.810
Really? Well, whenever you
 want some, just ask!

16:02.810 --> 16:03.520
Sure.

16:04.360 --> 16:06.360
Anyway, what do you wanna 
do about your bath?

16:06.360 --> 16:09.030
Hmm... I usually take mine at night, so...

16:09.990 --> 16:12.530
I was planning to bathe here.

16:12.990 --> 16:15.450
Go ahead and take yours after 
we're done eating, then.

16:15.820 --> 16:18.410
I wanna keep gaming right up until bedtime.

16:18.410 --> 16:21.000
O-Okay... I will.

16:21.250 --> 16:24.750
I just had mine, so you can just 
reheat the water and get right in.

16:29.210 --> 16:30.630
I'll just take a shower!

16:30.630 --> 16:33.630
Why? A good, long soak will warm you—

16:33.630 --> 16:34.760
Just a shower!

16:47.230 --> 16:48.480
I'll leave a towel right—

16:48.480 --> 16:50.440
What?! Did something happen?!

16:50.440 --> 16:52.700
N-No, nothing!

17:04.460 --> 17:06.750
Sorry to make you wait so long.

17:07.420 --> 17:09.000
What happened to your cheeks?

17:09.500 --> 17:11.550
They're all red.

17:11.800 --> 17:12.550
Huh?

17:13.420 --> 17:14.510
Why?

17:17.430 --> 17:20.260
<i>The mood's so awkward for some reason.</i>

17:20.260 --> 17:24.060
<i>Is Jun actually conscious of me, too?</i>

17:30.980 --> 17:35.820
<i>What can I do? Should I try 
saying something to him first?</i>

17:36.410 --> 17:37.950
Okay, Tomo!

17:38.320 --> 17:39.660
Let's play that game!

17:39.660 --> 17:41.120
<i>Wait, what?!</i>

17:41.910 --> 17:45.370
<b>FC VASIMR</b>

17:41.910 --> 17:45.370
<b>Hill Villagers</b>

17:42.240 --> 17:45.370
It's been a long time. 
Want me to go easy on you?

17:45.620 --> 17:47.420
Get over yourself!

17:47.830 --> 17:49.790
There! Go! That's it!

17:49.790 --> 17:52.590
My pass was good! You're wide open!

17:52.590 --> 17:55.760
Oh, yeah! And shoot!

17:55.760 --> 17:58.010
Score!

18:01.510 --> 18:03.770
You're not half bad.

18:04.850 --> 18:07.230
You'll never beat me at video games, either!

18:07.850 --> 18:10.190
Aw, damn it!

18:10.190 --> 18:12.400
I lost again!

18:12.400 --> 18:15.280
Because you just keep 
attacking and never defend.

18:15.570 --> 18:17.400
You need to think about how the game—

18:17.400 --> 18:19.240
Shut up, gamer kid!

18:19.660 --> 18:21.620
I told you not to call me that!

18:22.530 --> 18:24.580
Okay, I'm sorry!

18:33.170 --> 18:34.840
Wanna play another match?

18:34.840 --> 18:36.470
Yeah, sure.

18:37.760 --> 18:39.760
It's 9:00 already?

18:40.140 --> 18:42.850
What do you wanna do? Stay up late?

18:42.850 --> 18:45.350
Can you even stay up late?

18:45.350 --> 18:49.850
Don't underestimate me! 
I once stayed up until 11:30!

18:49.850 --> 18:52.860
That's all? I've...

18:53.650 --> 18:56.610
stayed up until midnight before.

18:56.610 --> 18:58.320
M-Midnight?!

18:58.570 --> 19:00.950
That's the next day!

19:00.950 --> 19:03.160
It's not that big a deal.

19:04.620 --> 19:05.870
Maybe...

19:06.330 --> 19:08.540
we really can't stay up late.

19:09.500 --> 19:10.870
Yeah, maybe.

19:16.300 --> 19:17.460
Goodnight.

19:17.460 --> 19:20.050
Yeah, goodnight.

19:22.180 --> 19:23.800
<i>It smells like Jun.</i>

19:25.220 --> 19:27.890
<i>We're really just gonna go to sleep now?</i>

19:28.890 --> 19:30.890
<i>It seems like such a waste.</i>

19:31.310 --> 19:33.150
<i>Wait, a waste of what?!</i>

19:33.690 --> 19:34.650
Tomo?

19:35.320 --> 19:36.570
You awake?

19:38.190 --> 19:39.320
What's up?

19:39.820 --> 19:41.860
Today was fun, huh?

19:43.660 --> 19:46.540
Do you think we're gonna...

19:46.950 --> 19:48.500
always be like...

19:52.210 --> 19:54.540
Jun, I...

19:57.500 --> 19:59.510
<i>That jerk!</i>

20:02.260 --> 20:05.640
<i>That's what his face looks like?</i>

20:05.640 --> 20:07.640
<i>I'm always so close to him,</i>

20:07.640 --> 20:11.520
<i>but I don't get many chances 
to just look at his face.</i>

20:14.940 --> 20:17.440
<i>Especially the little 
details like his ears.</i>

20:18.110 --> 20:20.400
<i>Oh, so this is what they look like?</i>

20:20.820 --> 20:21.900
<i>What about his nose?</i>

20:26.370 --> 20:28.480
<i>Oh, crap. This is kinda fun.</i>

20:35.920 --> 20:38.050
<i>Wh-What is this?!</i>

20:38.670 --> 20:40.380
<i>What is going on?!</i>

20:40.630 --> 20:41.550
Jun?!

21:09.990 --> 21:13.580
Jun, you sleep in the weirdest positions.

21:14.500 --> 21:17.500
Well, I'm off. See you at the dojo later.

21:17.500 --> 21:18.420
Yeah.

21:20.170 --> 21:23.550
<i>In spite of everything, that was really fun.</i>

21:23.550 --> 21:25.050
<i>I'm glad I came.</i>

21:25.970 --> 21:29.010
<i>But I feel like I'm forgetting something...</i>

21:29.010 --> 21:31.110
<i>Last night, I got to Jun's house,</i>

21:31.110 --> 21:32.460
<i>ate curry,</i>

21:32.460 --> 21:33.900
<i>took a shower,</i>

21:33.900 --> 21:35.230
<i>played games,</i>

21:35.230 --> 21:36.590
<i>went to sleep in the bed...</i>

21:40.350 --> 21:42.330
<i>and woke up in the futon?!</i>

21:47.190 --> 21:49.000
<i>After that, things between us...</i>

21:52.410 --> 21:53.760
What?

21:53.760 --> 21:55.220
Nothing.

21:55.880 --> 21:56.900
Okay, then.

22:04.910 --> 22:08.090
<i>...were like this for about a week.</i>

22:10.800 --> 22:14.560
<i>(This suspicious behavior is...)</i>

22:14.560 --> 22:18.850
<i>Hey, you know, I'm all mixed up</i>

22:18.850 --> 22:23.320
<i>It's too complicated, I'm freaking out</i>

22:23.320 --> 22:25.860
<i>I want to look cute to you</i>

22:23.650 --> 22:29.200
<i>(crazy, crazy, drive me crazy, and that's…)</i>

22:25.860 --> 22:28.490
<i>So I'm plotting, bargaining, 
sly, and stubborn</i>

22:29.200 --> 22:32.990
<i>Dizzying love</i>

22:34.160 --> 22:38.580
<i>Just tell him to look at you</i>

22:38.580 --> 22:43.550
<i>And watch him stiffen up even more, 
because you're both so awkward</i>

22:43.550 --> 22:47.420
<i>What? Even if we're alike in that way</i>

22:47.420 --> 22:52.010
<i>It doesn't make me happy, 'cause it
 means our love is going nowhere</i>

22:52.010 --> 23:00.900
<i>Cloudy heart, swirling emotions—
I sense rain coming</i>

23:00.900 --> 23:09.990
<i>So I partly open my umbrella, 
then sneakily scoot closer to you</i>

23:09.990 --> 23:13.950
<i>Please notice the curl of my 
eyelashes as I keep blinking</i>

23:13.950 --> 23:18.870
<i>And don't say I'm acting weird</i>

23:18.870 --> 23:22.840
<i>All this plotting and bargaining 
is my sly plan to look cute to you</i>

23:22.840 --> 23:27.880
<i>Try to solve the riddle of 
this soft, dizzying love</i>

23:25.750 --> 23:30.010
<i>(Buzzing, fidgeting)</i>

23:30.260 --> 23:34.810
<i>Listen, I might be a bit 
tangled in my own web now</i>

23:34.810 --> 23:38.850
<i>But once you unravel the mystery, 
you'll see pure lo-love</i>
